      "id": "claim_9a2123a8032648ae9a49ea9781cba3c4",
      "statement": "Flask is a WSGI application: the WSGI server calls Flask.__call__, which delegates to wsgi_app, and wsgi_app can be wrapped independently for middleware while retaining the Flask object.",
