      "id": "claim_e31af3fbf485418e83c877d7cbe166bc",
      "statement": "Response finalization converts handler output with make_response, runs after_this_request callbacks before reversed after_request callbacks, saves a non-null session, and emits request_finished; failures during error-response finalization are logged and suppressed in safe mode, while normal finalization failures propagate.",
