      "statement": "Request teardown is driven by RequestContext.pop: teardown_request callbacks run in reverse order, request_tearing_down is emitted, the request is closed and its ContextVar reset, and an app context owned by that request is then popped; app teardown callbacks and appcontext signals run during AppContext.pop.",
