      "id": "claim_c0c1fa1cc1f3419d818ef27aca1fd673",
      "statement": "Flask remains WSGI for async handlers: ensure_sync leaves synchronous functions unchanged and wraps coroutine functions through async_to_sync, whose default implementation uses asgiref; async support therefore waits for the coroutine within a WSGI worker rather than providing an ASGI runtime.",
